   "content": "<p>Reading Comprehension</p><p>1. What was the composition of the army of the Qureish that marched to Madina to attack the Muslims?</p><p>2. Why did the holy Rasool (ﷺ) suggest the defensive strategy in the the battle of a Uhud?</p><p>3. What was the opinion of youth with respect to facing the army of the Quraish?</p><p>4. Why did the holy Rasool (ﷺ) prefer the opinion of youths regarding facing the enemy in the battle of Uhud?</p><p>5. How did the course of the battle of Uhud change for a time in favour of the Quraish of Mecca?</p><p>6. What happened after the false rumour about the martyrdom of the holy Rasool (ﷺ) was spread by the Infidels?</p><p>7. What lesson does lie in the battle of Uhud for the Muslims in general?</p><p>8. What would have been the result of the battle had the archers not left their high post?</p><p>9. How would you relate the battle of Uhud to the battle of Badr?</p><p>Writing Suggestions</p><p>Narrate the whole event of the battle of Uhud giving it a proper beginning that may lead to the middle and then to its end.</p><p>Oral Communication</p><p>Ask the students to present their written work under &quot;Writing Suggestion&quot; in front of the class.</p><p>Vocabulary and Grammar</p><p>A. Search the following words related to Economy in an authentic source and write the correct word in front of its meaning below.</p><p>1. a continual increase in the price of goods and services ________</p><p>2. a period of time in which there is a decrease in economic activity and many people do not have jobs ________</p><p>3. a person who buys goods and services ________</p><p>4. a science concerned with the process or system by which goods and services are produced, sold, and bought ________</p><p>5. an amount (such as an amount of money) that is less than the amount that is needed ________</p><p>6. an amount of money available for spending that is based on a plan for how it will be spent ________</p><p>7. money that a bank or business will allow a person to use and then pay back in the future ________</p><p>8. money, property, etc., that is used to start or operate a business ________</p><p>9. of or relating to money and especially to the money a government, business, or organization earns, spends, and owes ________</p><p>10. the act of using money to earn more money: the act of investing money ________</p><p>11. the money that a country uses: a specific kind of money ________</p>",
